  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "A cantata in memory of his mother (Op. 37, written between 1970 and 1980), for a mature female voice, two young male voices, mixed and children's choir, chamber orchestra and military band — with the bouzouki as its central instrument.",
      "Sung by Maria Farantouri, Vasilis Lekkas and Giorgos Michalislis, with the Third Programme Choir and the Rotonda Children's Choir of Thessaloniki. A double album, with a cover by Giorgos Stathopoulos."
    ]
